            "description": {
              "content": "List the contracts and groups for your account. Each object contains the contract, groups associated with the contract, and whether Kona Site Defender or Web Application Protector is the product for that contract. You'll need this information when you create a new security configuration or when you want to get a list of hostnames still available for use in a security policy. _Products:_ All.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
